OL,3,GNEWSAA30 safety scheme: Seven months of
OL,4,Adelays expected
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists on Cornwall's A30 are being
OL,7,Fwarned to expect months of delays and
OL,8,Fdiversions as a #9.8m safety scheme is
OL,9,Fdelivered.
OL,11,FNational Highways said the work between
OL,12,FKennards House to Five Lanes was vital
OL,13,Fto make some of the dangerous junctions
OL,14,Falong the route safer.
OL,16,FIt includes the Plusha junction, which
OL,17,Fas been named as Cornwall's worst
OL,18,Faccident blackspot, with three
OL,19,Ffatalities in 2024 alone.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
