OL,3,GNEWSAA30 safety scheme: Seven months of
OL,4,Adelays expected
OL,5,
OL,6,FCornwall Councillor Adam Paynter said
OL,7,Fthe works could have been "planned
OL,8,Fbetter" as cars diverting to avoid long
OL,9,Ftailbacks were causing "real problems"
OL,10,Ffor villagers along the stretch.
